   "sourceHash": "e7ee9889708647aa5a2da1e91ff5e4b0038054058ef7d49345d75102bf4da415",
   "text": "一只手从黄铜器皿中取出温热的黄色草本药糊，旁边是一位斜躺的患者",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
